#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of xterm"
msgstr "Instalação do xterm"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>xterm</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>xterm</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:104
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/v0/{n;s/new:/new:kb=^?:/}' termcap &amp;&amp;\n"
"printf '\\tkbs=\\\\177,\\n' &gt;&gt; terminfo &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"TERMINFO=/usr/share/terminfo \\\n"
"./configure $XORG_CONFIG     \\\n"
"    --with-app-defaults=/etc/X11/app-defaults &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/v0/{n;s/new:/new:kb=^?:/}' termcap &amp;&amp;\n"
"printf '\\tkbs=\\\\177,\\n' &gt;&gt; terminfo &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"TERMINFO=/usr/share/terminfo \\\n"
"./configure $XORG_CONFIG      \\\n"
"    --with-app-defaults=/etc/X11/app-defaults &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install    &amp;&amp;\n"
"make install-ti &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v *.desktop /usr/share/applications/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install     &amp;&amp;\n"
"make install-ti &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v *.desktop /usr/share/applications/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i ... termcap</command>, <command>printf ... >> "
"terminfo</command>: These commands modify the terminal description so that "
"the Backspace key is expected to send the character with ASCII code 127. "
"This is done for consistency with the Linux console."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i ... termcap</command>, <command>printf ... >> "
"terminfo</command>: Esses comandos modificam a descrição do terminal de "
"forma que se espere que a tecla &quot;Backspace&quot; envie o caractere com "
"código &quot;ASCII&quot; &quot;127&quot;. Isso é feito para consistência com"
" o console do Linux."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>TERMINFO=/usr/share/terminfo</envar>: This ensures that the "
"<command>xterm</command> terminfo files are installed to the system terminfo"
" database."
msgstr ""
"<envar>TERMINFO=/usr/share/terminfo</envar>: Isso garante que os arquivos "
"&quot;terminfo&quot; do &quot;<command>xterm</command>&quot; sejam "
"instalados na base de dados &quot;terminfo&quot; do sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-app-defaults=...</parameter>: Sets the location for the "
"<filename class=\"directory\">app-defaults</filename> directory."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-app-defaults=...</parameter>: Configura o local para o "
"diretório &quot;<filename class=\"directory\">app-defaults</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>make install-ti</command>: This command installs corrected terminfo"
" description files for use with <application>xterm</application>."
msgstr ""
"<command>make install-ti</command>: Esse comando instala arquivos corrigidos"
" de descrição &quot;terminfo&quot; para uso com o "
"&quot;<application>xterm</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring xterm"
msgstr "Configurando o xterm"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are two ways to configure xterm.  You can add the X resource "
"definitions to the user's <filename>~/.Xresources</filename> file, or add "
"them to the system-wide <filename>$XORG_PREFIX/share/X11/app-"
"defaults/Xterm</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Existem duas maneiras de configurar o &quot;xterm&quot;. Você pode adicionar"
" as definições de recursos do &quot;X&quot; ao arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>~/.Xresources</filename>&quot; do(a) usuário(a) ou adicioná-"
"las ao arquivo abrangente a todo o sistema "
"&quot;<filename>$XORG_PREFIX/share/X11/app-defaults/Xterm</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order for xterm to follow the locale settings in the environment, use "
"TrueType fonts, and follow the Linux convention about the code sent by the "
"Backspace key, add the following definitions as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de que o &quot;xterm&quot; siga as configurações de "
"localidade no ambiente, use fontes &quot;TrueType&quot; e siga a convenção "
"do Linux a respeito do código enviado pela tecla &quot;Backspace&quot;, "
"adicione as seguintes definições como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xterm.xml:181
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/X11/app-defaults/XTerm &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>*VT100*locale: true\n"
"*VT100*faceName: Monospace\n"
"*VT100*faceSize: 10\n"
"*backarrowKeyIsErase: true\n"
"*ptyInitialErase: true</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/X11/app-defaults/XTerm &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>*VT100*locale: true\n"
"*VT100*faceName: Monospace\n"
"*VT100*faceSize: 10\n"
"*backarrowKeyIsErase: true\n"
"*ptyInitialErase: true</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

